  <data name="ABOUTUS_COMMUNITY_SECTION_TEXT" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome, we hope you find what you are looking for. If you did't know already this is...! We are dedicated to serving our community with love and compassion. Our mission is to create a welcoming space where everyone feels valued and supported. Join us in making a positive impact!</value>
