  <data name="ABOUTUS_BELIEF_SECTION_TITLE" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What We Believe</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ABOUTUS_BELIEF_SECTION_TEXT" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Inspired by this truth, we affirm Jesus Christ as Lord and Saviour, who brings forgiveness, renewal, and a shared purpose to His Church. It is through Him that we are called to work together, celebrating our diversity while standing united in His love. This belief has driven the creation of this website as a means to connect, uplift, and equip churches across the Forest of Dean. Our mission is to bring communities together by supporting and promoting churches and enabling those around us to discover what lies within the Forest Of Dean.</value>
  </data>
